==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hackey]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**14 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**7 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**7 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stack up long-range anti-red damage dealers to quickly kill Hackey after activating the base, so it doesn't kill too many of your units or kill your base when the Condemned Pengs inevitably push toward your base. Spam meatshields and anti-aku/anti-red units that outrange or attack faster than the Condemned Pengs and you should eventually kill everything.

[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]] is a VERY good meatshield since it has surge immunity and a fast recharge rate, and can hold the frontline for a moment when the Condemned Pengs' surge on death kill your other units.

